# Conformance probe pack for a count stored as items - 1 (`plus -1`, spec 0.21
# ruling 7), most significant bit first. Public. No kinds.
#
#   n           an 8-bit count: the number of nums minus 1
#   x           8 bits
#   nums        n + 1 items, val in 8 bits each
format     conformance-extents-plus
version    0.21.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
count n 8 plus -1
field   probe.x  8  uint
group   probe.nums count @n
  field  probe.val  8  uint
end
